      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The titan reaches between realities to drag foes closer. They attempt an Athletics check and compare the result to the Fortitude DCs of all foes within 120 feet. On a success, a foe is teleported to any square the titan chooses within 120 feet; on a critical success, it's also paralyzed for 1 round. The titan can Grab any foe brought within 30 feet as a free action."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Hundred-Handed Whirlwind",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 2,
        "symbol": "◆◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The titan overwhelms opponents with blows both conventional and interplanar. They make one void weapon Strike against each foe within reach. Even on a failed attack (but not a critical failure), the titan deals 24 force damage to the target. This counts as three attacks for the titan's multiple attack penalty."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Send Beyond",
      "category": "action",
      "placement": "bot",
      "activity": {
        "unit": "action",
        "number": 1,
        "symbol": "◆"
      },
      "traits": [],
      "entries": [
        "The titan thrusts the creature into a nightmare realm full of lightless hands and eyes. This has the effects of maze (DC 48), but the creature can use Occultism to escape in addition to Perception or Survival. The titan can't use Send Beyond for 1d4 rounds."
      ],
      "requirements": "The titan has a creature grabbed"
    },
